==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Cat Giraffe Modoki (Special Cat)|Cat Giraffe Modoki]], [[Catnip Tricky (Special Cat)|Catnip Tricky]] and [[Catnip Dragon (Special Cat)|Catnip Dragon]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[White Wind]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Wind]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage, even with the restriction of only using the [[JRA Collaboration Event|JRA Collaboration]] units, the enemy serves practically no threat at all.

